                          "name": "Badge",
                          "context": "Count Badge · variant=danger (merged from C14 Notification Badge, Owner 2026-09-29: follow code CountBadge). Unread/alert count on an icon button. Text prop: Count (1–99, then 99+; hidden at 0). caption 11/semibold, badge.danger.* colours, padding 2/8, radius full. Spec: docs/design-system/components/count-badge.md",
