                                      "id": "RmPmQ",
                                      "name": "Source actions",
                                      "context": "Action Menu · size=sm state=closed. Trigger = Icon Button/Ghost (ellipsis; 32 px; open = background-hover). Menu absolute, right-aligned, 4 px below; fill via Replace(<instance>/RCAAJ/JoK1p, …): icon items, Divider, destructive last. Needs aria-label on the trigger. Spec: docs/design-system/components/action-menu.md",
