                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "Yq0Wk",
                          "name": "Akses klien",
                          "context": "Section Card · titled card for any grouped content (C43, Owner 2026-10-01; renamed from Form Section). Header: Title (subtitle 16/bold) + Description (body-sm). Slot Content accepts fields, List Card, Table, Empty State, Alert, Metric Tile, Segmented Control, Switch, Checkbox, Radio. Variants: Default (desktop/tablet insets), Compact (phone). Spec: docs/design-system/components/section-card.md",
