              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "OXpZp",
                  "name": "Modal",
                  "context": "Modal · size=md (560). Text: Title, Description (boolean). Boolean: Close. Slots: Body (fields, text, table…), Actions (Button Secondary + Primary, or + Danger for destructive confirms). Show inside the App Shell Overlay (scrim). Spec: docs/design-system/components/modal.md",
                  "metadata": {
                    "type": "component",
                    "component": "modal",
                    "role": "base"
